        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "### The Prompt Assembly Line\n\n\nIt takes the raw ideas from the AI Art Analyst and the other inputs and carefully combines, refines, and formats them into a perfect, final script for the \"Master Scene Director\" AI.  \n  \n* Master Key: The brain of the operation. You can use the preset template for etnicity, structure, body shape etc. \n* Shot type: Enter the type of [camera shot](https://zanno.se/learn-to-control-the-perspective/) you want to use  \n* Action: Enter the type of action (Hiking, having a coffee, realaxing etc) you want in your image/video  \n* World Weaver: Here you can enter where (Mount Fuji, café in Italy etc), or you can enter passive action (deep contemplation for example)\n\n"
      ],
      "color": "#641f64",
      "bgcolor": "#500b50",
      "shape": 1
